 your first message.</li></ol>\r\n        <p>These instructions assume provisioned artifacts; they are not a one-line installer. The source checkout README.md includes dependency installation and model provisioning commands. Never share your local key.</p>\r\n      </section>\r\n      <section class="section release" id="status" aria-labelledby="status-title">\r\n        <span class="eyebrow">HONEST BY DESIGN · SUPPORT MATRIX</span>\r\n        <h2 id="status-title">A working foundation.<br>Not a finished release.</h2>\r\n        <p class="lead">Platform capabilities and support boundaries read directly from verified session artifacts and <code>docs/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md</code>. Native packages, hardware voice, vision, and desktop installers remain unverified release blockers.</p>\r\n        \r\n        <div class="status-matrix-container">\r\n          <table class="status-matrix">\r\n            <thead>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <th>Platform / Scope</th>\r\n                <th>Status</th>\r\n                <th>Support Boundary &amp; Evidence</th>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </thead>\r\n            <tbody>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Linux x86_64, WSL Ubuntu 22.04</strong></td>\r\n                <td><span class="badge-verified">Verified (Dev)</span></td>\r\n                <td>Confined CPU runtime, local chat, RAG, and audio file speech. Development configuration with pre-provisioned models.</td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Windows Host UI → Gateway</strong></td>\r\n                <td><span class="badge-verified">Verified (Dev)</span></td>\r\n                <td>Chromium UI running against local loopback gateway. Full chat, tabs, knowledge, history, and dictation.</td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Hosted Source CI</strong></td>\r\n                <td><span class="badge-verified">Verified (CI)</span></td>\r\n                <td>Ubuntu/macOS/Windows source gates and Rust foundations pass on GitHub Actions.</td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Native Windows Desktop (.exe)</strong></td>\r\n                <td><span class="badge-unverified">UNVERIFIED</span></td>\r\n                <td>Native Windows runtime and desktop installer not yet available. Release blocker.</td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Native macOS Desktop / MLX</strong></td>\r\n                <td><span class="badge-unverified">UNVERIFIED</span></td>\r\n                <td>Native containment, Apple Silicon MLX adapter, and macOS desktop package pending.</td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>T1 Hardware Voice Pipeline</strong></td>\r\n                <td><span class="badge-unverified">UNVERIFIED</span></td>\r\n                <td>Full realtime WS voice, streaming TTS, and barge-in pending. Physical audio unverified.</td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>NVIDIA GPU Serving (vLLM/SGLang)</strong></td>\r\n                <td><span class="badge-unverified">UNVERIFIED</span></td>\r\n                <td>Hardware GPU adapter not implemented; no serving claim.</td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n              <tr>\r\n                <td><strong>Air-gapped LAN Release Bundle</strong></td>\r\n                <td><span class="badge-partial">Partial</span></td>\r\n                <td>Signed offline distribution bundle, TLS, and crypto storage pending.</td>\r\n              </tr>\r\n            </tbody>\r\n          </table>\r\n        </div>\r\n\r\n        <div class="actions" style="margin-top: 24px;">\r\n          <a class="button" href="/">Explore the local application ↗</a>\r\n          <a class="button secondary" href="/docs.html">Read technical docs →</a>\r\n        </div>\r\n      </section>\r\n    <!-- workflow-status:start -->\r\n<section id="workflow-status